{"name":"Biloxi Blue","hex":"#0075b8","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"}],"entries":[{"title":"Biloxi, Mississippi","blocks":[{"text":"Biloxi is a city in Harrison County, Mississippi, United States. It lies on the Gulf Coast in southern Mississippi, bordering the city of Gulfport to its west. The adjacent cities are both designated as seats of Harrison County. The population of Biloxi was 49,449 at the 2020 census, making it the state's fourth-most populous city. It is a principal city of the Gulfport–Biloxi metropolitan area, home to 416,259 residents in 2020. The area's first European settlers were French colonists."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/BiloxiLightHouseandVisitorsCenter.jpg/330px-BiloxiLightHouseandVisitorsCenter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Biloxi%2C_Mississippi","wikidata":"Q490720"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. The clear daytime sky and the deep sea appear blue because of an optical effect known as Rayleigh scattering. An optical effect called the Tyndall effect explains blue eyes. Distant objects appear more blue because of another optical effect called aerial perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg/330px-Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue","wikidata":"Q1088"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/WC-130J_taking_off_from_Keesler_Air_Force_Base_in_Mississippi.jpg/500px-WC-130J_taking_off_from_Keesler_Air_Force_Base_in_Mississippi.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/WC-130J_taking_off_from_Keesler_Air_Force_Base_in_Mississippi.jpg/1280px-WC-130J_taking_off_from_Keesler_Air_Force_Base_in_Mississippi.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/WC-130J_taking_off_from_Keesler_Air_Force_Base_in_Mississippi.jpg/500px-WC-130J_taking_off_from_Keesler_Air_Force_Base_in_Mississippi.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWC-130J_taking_off_from_Keesler_Air_Force_Base_in_Mississippi.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Biloxi_Natl_Cemetery_Entrance.jpg/500px-Biloxi_Natl_Cemetery_Entrance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Biloxi_Natl_Cemetery_Entrance.jpg/1280px-Biloxi_Natl_Cemetery_Entrance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Biloxi_Natl_Cemetery_Entrance.jpg/500px-Biloxi_Natl_Cemetery_Entrance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABiloxi_Natl_Cemetery_Entrance.jpg"},{"srcset":